<newsitem itemid="572220" id="root" date="1997-05-09" xml:lang="en">
<title>HONG KONG: Metrobank launches US$140 mln FRCD.</title>
<headline>Metrobank launches US$140 mln FRCD.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was announced by lead manager Deutsche Morgan Grenfell.</p>
<p> BORROWER   METROPOLITAN BANK &amp; TRUST CO</p>
<p> AMOUNT     US$140 MLN  COUPON     3ML+65BP  MATURITY  5 YRS</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRCD	  ISS PRICE  PAR	 LAUNCH   09.MAY.97</p>
<p> PUTS	 NONE	  CALLS	NONE	REPLIES  26.MAY.97</p>
<p> LISTING    NONE	  REPAYMENT  BULLET    DENOMS   $250K</p>
<p> RATING     --	    SALE LMTS  STANDARD  TAX PROV  --</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	   CRS DEF    YES	 FORCE MAJ --</p>
<p> HOME CTRY  PHILIPPINES GOV LAW    --	  PAY DATE 06.JUN.97</p>
<p>MGT LEVELS AND FEES</p>
<p>   CO-LEAD MANAGERS    US$10 MLN+   45BP  ALL-IN  74</p>
<p>   SENIOR MANAGERS     US$6-9 MLN   40BP  ALL-IN  73</p>
<p>   MANAGERS		US$2-5 MLN   35BP  ALL-IN  72</p>
<p> LEAD MANAGERS   DEUTSCHE MORGAN GRENFELL, DEVELOPMENT BANK OF</p>
<p>		     SINGAPORE AND TOKYO-MITSUBISHI (HK).</p>
<p> NOTES	     CLEARING THROUGH EUROCLEAR/CEDEL</p>
<p>		     SIGNING IS SET FOR JUNE 2.</p>
<p>--Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6960</p>
</text>
